.el .ds Aq '
.TH tine-serve 1  "serve " 
.SH NAME
tine\-serve \- Run a graph\*(Aqs owner for the command line. Read commands start it when the app does not have the graph open; it exits after 30 idle minutes or when the app opens the graph
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine serve\fR [\fB\-\-stop\fR] [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIGRAPH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a graph\*(Aqs owner for the command line. Read commands start it when the app does not have the graph open; it exits after 30 idle minutes or when the app opens the graph
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-stop\fR
Ask the graph\*(Aqs command\-line owner to finish its work and exit
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIGRAPH\fR>

